What this licence covers

It covers the files written for this project: everything under server/, mac/,
wii/ (except the loader code inside the .xml), title/, tools/, patches/, docs/,
the launcher scripts in the top folder, and these files in
SMGNetworkMultiplayer/: source/playerColors.cpp, source/progressSync.cpp,
include/playerColors.hpp, include/progressSync.hpp and
include/packets/gameProgress.hpp, plus our changes to the other files there.

It does NOT cover:

  * The rest of SMGNetworkMultiplayer/, which is Headpenguin's
    SMGNetworkMultiplayer (https://github.com/Headpenguin/SMGNetworkMultiplayer).
    That project is published without a licence; its code remains its
    author's. See CREDITS.md.
  * The Syati/Bussun loader code embedded in riivolution/riivo_USA.xml and
    wii/SD-card/riivolution/SMGOnline_USA.xml, which belongs to its authors.
  * Super Mario Galaxy itself. No part of the game is included here; you need
    your own copy.
